## Title Generation Guidelines

### 1. Core Requirements
- Maximum {{ max_length }} characters
- Benefit-focused language
- Professional, authoritative tone
- No clickbait or sensationalism
- Clear and descriptive

### 2. Optimization Strategy: {{ optimization_strategy }}

{% if optimization_strategy == "benefit_driven" %}
- Lead with primary benefit
- Use action-oriented verbs
- Include outcome-focused language
- Emphasize transformation or result
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "problem_solution" %}
- Address specific pain point
- Position as the solution
- Use problem-solution language
- Create urgency and relevance
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "scarcity_urgency" %}
- Imply limited availability
- Use time-sensitive language
- Create FOMO (Fear Of Missing Out)
- Include urgency triggers
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "social_proof" %}
- Include social proof elements
- Use popularity indicators
- Mention user count or success stories
- Build trust and credibility
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "risk_reversal" %}
- Emphasize guarantee or trial
- Remove purchase barriers
- Build confidence and trust
- Address risk concerns
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "premium_positioning" %}
- Emphasize exclusivity and quality
- Use premium language
- Highlight superior features
- Justify premium pricing
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "value_proposition" %}
- Focus on ROI and value
- Use comparison language
- Highlight savings and efficiency
- Emphasize long-term benefits
{% endif %}

