## Title Optimization Techniques

### 1. Power Words
{% if optimization_strategy == "benefit_driven" %}
Transform, Master, Unlock, Discover, Achieve, Boost, Accelerate, Optimize
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "problem_solution" %}
Solve, Fix, Eliminate, Overcome, Resolve, Conquer, Address
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "scarcity_urgency" %}
Limited, Exclusive, Instant, Now, Today, Only, Don't miss
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "social_proof" %}
Proven, Trusted, Popular, Best-selling, Thousands, Recommended
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "risk_reversal" %}
Guaranteed, Risk-free, Protected, Safe, Trial, Money-back, No-risk
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "premium_positioning" %}
Premium, Elite, Professional, Ultimate, Exclusive, Luxury, High-end
{% endif %}

{% if optimization_strategy == "value_proposition" %}
Save, Value, ROI, Efficient, Economical, Cost-effective, Investment
{% endif %}

### 2. Title Structures
- [Benefit] + [Product Type]: "Transform Your Workflow with Professional Templates"
- [Problem] + [Solution]: "Stop Wasting Time: Complete Guide to [Topic]"
- [Audience] + [Product Type]: "Beginner's Guide to [Topic]"
- [Result] + [Product Type]: "Master [Skill] with Comprehensive [Product Type]"
- [Time] + [Benefit]: "30-Day [Result] with [Product Type]"
- [Number] + [Benefit]: "7 Essential [Tools] for [Audience]"

## Quality Requirements

### 1. Content Standards
- No placeholder text or incomplete thoughts
- Proper grammar and spelling
- Clear, concise language
- Professional, authoritative tone
- Kade persona compliance

### 2. Technical Requirements
- Within {{ max_length }} character limit
- SEO-friendly where applicable
- Mobile-friendly display
- Clear value proposition
- No trademark violations

### 3. Marketing Requirements
- Benefit-focused language
- Action-oriented verbs
- Emotional appeal where appropriate
- Clear differentiation from competitors
- Compelling and memorable

## Output Format

Generate 3-5 optimized title options, each with:
1. Title text (within {{ max_length }} characters)
2. Brief explanation of optimization approach
3. Target audience appeal analysis
4. SEO considerations if applicable

## Final Instructions

1. Generate titles that are compelling and professional
2. Ensure each title meets the character limit
3. Maintain Kade persona throughout
4. Focus on value and benefits for {{ target_audience }}
5. Use appropriate language for {{ product_type }}
6. Avoid clickbait or misleading claims
7. Ensure titles are unique and memorable
8. Consider SEO and discoverability
9. Test for clarity and impact
10. Align with {{ optimization_strategy }} strategy

Remember: The title is the first impression and must immediately communicate value and relevance to the target audience.
